      "comment": "Requirements for the Bosch BMA4xx accelerometer driver, derived from the BMA423 data sheet. Companion to safety.jsonld: the requirements trace to ZEP-SYRS-4, \"Device Driver Abstraction\", which that document defines.\nGenerated from the @satisfies and @verifies annotations in the driver and its test suite rather than from a twister campaign, so it carries declared traceability only: no EvaluationResult and no EvidenceRelationship, and every requirement's evidence verdict says its tests were not run."
